---
import IndexLayout from "../layouts/IndexLayout.astro";
import { USES } from "../consts";
---

<IndexLayout title={USES.title} description={USES.description}>
  <div class="page">
    <h1>Uses.</h1>
    <p>
      These are some of the languages, tools, and technologies I work with when
      building software. I'll update this page as my setup changes.
    </p>

    <section aria-labelledby="languages-heading">
      <h2 id="languages-heading">Languages</h2>
      <p>
        I work with <strong>Go</strong> for backend services and{" "}
        <strong>TypeScript</strong> for web applications.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="web-heading">
      <h2 id="web-heading">Web development</h2>
      <p>
        I use <strong>Astro</strong> for this website and{" "}
        <strong>Next.js</strong> for the Leamout console.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="infrastructure-heading">
      <h2 id="infrastructure-heading">Infrastructure</h2>
      <p>
        I work with <strong>PostgreSQL</strong>, <strong>Redis</strong>, and{
          " "
        }
        <strong>NATS JetStream</strong> for persistent data, fast state, and messaging.
        I use <strong>Docker</strong> to run services during development.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section aria-labelledby="workflow-heading">
      <h2 id="workflow-heading">Workflow</h2>
      <p>
        I use <strong>Git</strong> and <strong>GitHub</strong> to manage code, review
        changes, and collaborate across repositories.
      </p>
    </section>

    <p class="related">
      For what I'm currently focused on, see{" "}<a href="/now">Now</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</IndexLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-top: 2rem;
  }

  h1,
  h2 {
    font-size: var(--font-size-m);
    font-weight: var(--font-weight-bold);
  }

  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
  }

  section {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
  }

  p {
    margin: 0 0 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  a {
    color: var(--text-primary);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--text-tertiary);
    text-underline-offset: 0.2em;
  }

  a:hover {
    text-decoration-color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .related {
    margin-top: 2.75rem;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--font-size-s);
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .page {
      padding-top: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
